<title>USA: Harris County, Texas, $4.2 mln awarded. [CORRECTED 22:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Harris County, Texas, $4.2 mln awarded. [CORRECTED 22:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest Co said Tuesday it won $4.2 million (corrects from $1.97 million) Harris County Utility District 1 (corrects from District 4), Texas, waterworks and sewer system combination tax and revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 6.179 percent.  </p>
<p>AMT: 4,200,000	DATE: 11/12/96	NYC Time: 1400	CUSIP: 953085</p>
<p>ISSUER: Harris Co Municipal Utility District 1		  ST: TX</p>
<p>ISSUE: Wtrwrks &amp; swr sys comb revenue series 1996	     TAX STAT:Exempt-ULT</p>
